<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quilmes cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Quilmes Industrial SA to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-listed American Depositary Shares fell 1/4 to 11-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
